mcp-scanner binaries include the software listed below. Each entry names the
component, the version this file was generated for, its license, and the
license and notice files exactly as that component distributes them.

Entries marked "yara build only" are linked only by `make build-yara`. That
build also links the system libyara library dynamically; libyara itself is
not part of the binary.

Entries marked "windows build only" are linked only into Windows binaries.

Linux and Windows release binaries built by `make dist` statically link C
runtime libraries from the build host's toolchain (Ubuntu 24.04 in the release
workflow). The entries after the Go modules identify these libraries and the
binaries that include them. macOS release binaries dynamically link the
operating system's C library, which is not included in the binary.

